-- ============================================================
-- Research Summit — Superinvestor 13F backfill (2021 -> present)
-- Run this in the Supabase SQL Editor AFTER 014_investor_profiles.sql
--
-- Generated by a one-off script (not checked into the repo) that
-- pulls every 13F-HR filing since 2021 for each superinvestor CIK
-- from SEC EDGAR, parses the info-table XML the same way the
-- "Upload 13F" flow does, and matches tickers against SEC's own
-- company_tickers.json (exact-name match only — see the script for
-- why the portal's ALL_STOCKS substring-match approach is unsafe
-- for an unsupervised bulk write). A blank ticker means no exact
-- match was found (or the name matched more than one ticker, e.g.
-- Alphabet's GOOG/GOOGL both file under the issuer name "ALPHABET
-- INC") — company_name/cusip/weight_pct are always correct
-- regardless; a human can fill in the ticker later same as an
-- unresolved row in the manual upload flow.
--
-- Each (investor_key, year, quarter) is deleted before its insert,
-- so this is safe to re-run and safe to run even though Ackman
-- Q2 2025 - Q1 2026 already has hand-seeded rows from 014 (this
-- replaces them with the same source data, now with more tickers
-- resolved).
-- ============================================================

-- ─── ackman ───
